WEBVTT

00:31:29.579 --> 00:31:33.038
a chat bot that kind of
constantly steers us

00:31:33.038 --> 00:31:34.996
and helps us make better decisions
than we could.

00:31:35.954 --> 00:31:39.871
But in any case, I think the fundamental
thing is it's not like the humans versus

00:31:39.871 --> 00:31:46.246
the eyes competing to be the. Smartest
sentient thing on earth or beyond.

00:31:46.871 --> 00:31:49.204
But it's that this idea of
being on the same team.

00:31:50.121 --> 00:31:56.038
Hmm. I certainly get very excited by the
sort of the medium term potential

00:31:56.038 --> 00:32:00.621
for creative people of all sorts if
they're willing to expand their palette